  moveName: Thunder Fang
  description: "After a brief windup, lunge in the designated direction, biting
    enemies along the path and stunning them for 0.5s. Hitting an enemy grants
    60% movement speed for 1.5s. Full Volt Absorb is consumed to empower both bites
    and grant one second use within 4s after the first lunge. The cooldown starts
    after the second use or when that window expires. Walls stop the lunge.
    Upgrade extends the on-hit movement-speed boost to 2s."
